-*   **Buffer Layout:** Row-major contiguous memory. Each transfer function occupies a block of $4096 \times 4$ bytes. Within each block, entry $i$ (where $i \in [0, 4095]$) stores 4 bytes: Red, Green, Blue, Alpha.
